WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.544
The lasting idea: a set of unlabeled test images
can supervise itself.

00:00:04.624 --> 00:00:06.922
By letting images score one another,

00:00:07.002 --> 00:00:10.753
repeating normal structure is separated from rare defects,

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.602
with no training or prompts,

00:00:12.682 --> 00:00:17.490
giving state-of-the-art zero-shot detection that
rivals full-shot methods.
